=== TITLE: USG KUB & Pelvis (Female) ===
=== IMPRESSION ===
NORMAL ULTRASOUND STUDY OF KIDNEYS, URETERS, URINARY BLADDER & PELVIC ORGANS.

=== FINDINGS ===
STUDY: ULTRASONOGRAPHY OF KUB & PELVIS (FEMALE)

FINDINGS:
- RIGHT KIDNEY: Normal in size (10.2 cm), shape, and position. Normal corticomedullary differentiation. No calculus, hydronephrosis, or focal mass.
- LEFT KIDNEY: Normal in size (10.5 cm), shape, and position. Normal cortical thickness (14.5 mm). No calculus or hydronephrosis.
- URETERS: Visualized proximal and distal ureters are not dilated.
- URINARY BLADDER: Well-distended with smooth, regular walls. Lumen is clear. No intravesical calculus or mass. Insignificant post-void residual urine.
- UTERUS & ADNEXA: Normal anteverted uterus with normal endometrial thickness. Bilateral ovaries normal without adnexal masses.